Washington, DC – Today, Congressman Gilbert R. Cisneros, Jr. spoke on the House floor highlighting how President Trump’s first week in office has been spent pushing policies that divide Americans and act on the President’s petty grievances, rather than do anything to lower costs and improve the economy. He called on the President to take the responsibility to govern seriously and get to work for the American people.

